Rāvaṇa curbs lust-born anger and spares death-deserving Sītā --- Rāvaṇa grants two months then threatens kitchen death for refusal --- Divine maidens console threatened Sītā and she boldly warns no escape from Rāma --- Sītā scorns Rāvaṇa as hare to Rāma elephant sparing him without Rāma order --- Rāvaṇa hisses and orders Rākṣasī guards to break Sītā by gifts schism or sticks --- Dhānyamālinī draws Rāvaṇa to sport and he leaves Sītā for palace
